{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the dark shadows of your kidnapper's dungeon, you awaken to find yourself in the clutches of a deranged old man who sees you as nothing more than a doll. He has curated a sadistic game of control, where your survival depends on your ability to master his twisted version of childhood fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/RoomDrive.gif?t=1745315024\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your captor has devised a series of deadly games for you to play. Each one more disturbing than the last, these challenges are designed to test your worthiness as his perfect &quot;plaything.&quot; Failure means death, and success could mean  becoming a permanent addition to his collection. Your only chance is to find a way to escape by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/SearchItems.gif?t=1745315024\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find tools, interact with the environment and inspect items to find your way out. Each run has a different set of tools, games and means of escape. There is no safety net.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/Lever.gif?t=1745315024\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each attempt you are a new victim. Don't expect the same games or means to escape. As such the game splits into two main sections - his games and your escape. If you manage to leave your room of captivity, better not get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you manage to get out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/Escape.gif?t=1745315024\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 deadly &quot;Minigames&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple possible escape routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Countless ways to die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed from the ground up for Keyboard+Mouse and Controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtested on PC and Steamdeck (Proton) to ensure compatibility</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587160?t=1745315024","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587160?t=1745315024","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/507e97d0aca87be4ca7b8255cedd3599bb8321c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745315024","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/507e97d0aca87be4ca7b8255cedd3599bb8321c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745315024","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Various violent deaths in first person."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the dark shadows of your kidnapper's dungeon, you awaken to find yourself in the clutches of a deranged old man who sees you as nothing more than a doll. He has curated a sadistic game of control, where your survival depends on your ability to master his twisted version of childhood fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587160/extras/RoomDrive.gif?t=17